{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act23side_level_act23side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act23side",
  "stageId": "act23side_04",
  "title": "不念往昔",
  "storyCode": "WB-4",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "280355828e5a2c22fc2ab709fd16a300edce1ad4ea68662ffed4742f17d99e85",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g2_yumenstreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧掌櫃",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸欸，莫名其妙闖進來，轉了一圈就走，那漢子到底是幹什麼的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "掌櫃的，難道是巡防營的便衣，來看咱們有沒有收留走私犯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧掌櫃",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看他直直愣愣莽莽撞撞的樣子，哪有那麼扎眼的便衣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就是來挑事的，我去把他抓回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧掌櫃",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你追得上嗎？人家一眨眼就去了半箭地，明顯會輕功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛才是最後一間客棧，沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個女娃說要出城，但也不在城門口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她傷重，用的都是最好的藥，要是追不回來，醫生保不齊把這筆錢算在我的頭上，那還了得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一定要把她逮回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g11_yanroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鯉先生的比方，我有點聽不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是個不恰當的例子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在龍門開那一間小小的事務所，只為混口飯吃，沒成想生意竟然不賴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可見羽毛蒜皮、醃臢瑣碎的事，總少不了，也不能事事都指望魏彥吾和近衛局來處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總得有林先生這樣的好市民來幫忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是無可奈何的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是無可奈何......龍門如此，玉門也是如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玉門終年在北部邊境巡航，是為了將種種危險拒於大炎國門之外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可在早些年，源石技術還遠沒有發展到今天這個地步的時候，維繫玉門這樣一座移動要塞的正常運轉，需要數倍的人力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好在那個時候，有那麼一批有志於為國效力的習武之人，主動奔赴玉門。他們沒有正式加入軍伍，但實際上幫玉門解決了不少後顧之憂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "護送信使，勘探前路，甚至是與軍隊同赴戰場......玉門百年安穩，離不開他們。這些武人在城中，自然也是受人敬重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "廟堂江湖，上下一心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是玉門曾經的樣子......直到二十年前的一場意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "山海眾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯。同樣是因為山海眾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g3_yumenobservationtower_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也沒別的事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望沒有耽誤平祟侯的公務。不然我有幾個腦袋也不夠砍的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你明知道我不會同意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一聲短暫的鳴笛後，城樓的軍用源石照明系統突然關閉，兩人的對話斷入黑暗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "只片刻工夫，搖曳的光明自遠處亮起。\n軍士們往來奔行，十步一崗，烽火次第傳開。\n十七聲鼓在此時擂響，又被高速移動的玉門城潑進夜色，在空氣中拖出逶迤的長音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天是望烽節的第二天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "設立望烽節，是為了提醒玉門人銘記過往。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這場見面，要嘛再早一些，要嘛再遲一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那時候平祟侯應該已經想起了一些事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從來沒有忘記過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "平祟侯還記不記得，這些為玉門犧牲的英烈裡，有多少並不是玉門的軍士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們不欠玉門的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玉門同樣不虧欠任何人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姓左的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防營守軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_796_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "退下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二十年前，我的確疏忽大意，讓那夥賊人喬裝成玉門武人，混進城傷了百姓。你可以怨我，哪怕讓我償命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你要問罪，也只該問我，或者問你自己！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一切罪責，當然由我一人承擔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是怎麼承擔的？這麼多年來，疏遠那些為玉門流過血汗的江湖兄弟，甚至要把他們通通逼走，就算你承擔了嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玉門要給他們一個交代！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玉門是大炎的玉門。它做的所有事，都是為了保億萬大炎百姓平安。這便是我的交代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣遼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請回吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g11_yanroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“山海眾”，不是人人都知道的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也不能怪誰疏忽，當時只知道戒備外敵，並不知道暗處還有敵人想對玉門不利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鏢客、拳師、武器工匠......這些玉門武人常與守軍並肩作戰，當年在玉門城內也算往來自由。山海眾恰恰利用了這一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城中缺少防備，各方面反應都慢了一步。雖然最終阻止了山海眾破壞城市核心動力源的計劃，但還是承受了不少傷亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打那之後......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "應該是亡獸補牢，為時不晚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不如說，“矯枉過正”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打那之後，平祟侯開始對城中管理進行改制。一應事務不再依賴江湖人士，人員流動也多了不少限制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還留在此地的人，有的投身軍伍，有的收起刀，安心過普通百姓的日子。也許隨便哪家客棧後廚的掌勺，當年就是名震一方的刀客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二十年啊......夠一個城市變幾番面貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸也老是說，龍門總有一天，不會再有下城區，也不再需要鼠王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果有一天，這座城市不用永遠在荒野上巡航，城中自然也無需人人帶刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "時代終歸會變的，有人想推一把，有人想拉一把。到最後，所有人都會被拋在後面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽到的就是這樣一段往事，也不知道能幫到雨霞姑娘多少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......幫到了很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多謝鯉先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g2_yumenstreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們打探清楚了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉門武人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是十人隊，一個時辰輪班的編制。沙渠那邊沒有額外的守軍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，和我看到的一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再託付你們一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明晚酉時，在沙渠附近鬧點動靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別太過火，引開巡邏隊就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉門武人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您這是要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是還信我，就別問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉門武人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉門武人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您剛才在城樓上，是見過左宣遼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟鐵衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，見過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g5_swordcastingworkshop"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "越來越熱了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨晚有人行刺魏彥吾，把玉門軍營弄得桃花亂飛，泥臭熏天。那個刺客，應該也是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所到之處，氣候如此反常，這是源石技藝，還是別的什麼把戲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "截殺信使，搶奪天災數據未果，便接連行刺朝廷要員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "山海眾，究竟視玉門為何物？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一座目的地錯了的城而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "目的地錯了，就不該再往前走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們知道玉門歸國的目的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不難猜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "父親命我三日內辦成三件事，追回宗師佩劍，抓捕刺客，找出潛藏在城內的山海眾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想不到，都落在這小小的鑄劍坊裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐怕你一件都辦不成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "往後站，這人武功深不可測，我們不是對手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒那個豐蹄漢子能打，反應倒是比他機靈一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然是你傷了太合先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛剛那一刀，你躲開了。那下一刀，是躲還是接？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "既不躲，也不接。\n那人常跟她說，為了報仇也好，為了安身立命也好，習武，就要有徒步登高的打算。越是力有不逮，越是要堅定心志。\n既見仇敵，又見高山，所以自己在他身邊待了整整五年。\n贏不了的仗，那就但求不輸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以攻為守？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也算有點膽識......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但，你是不是想得太簡單了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "武器相交的那一瞬，她才知道自己的決定有多輕率。\n她此刻面對的，竟然是另一座高山。\n寒光拂面，鼻尖撞碎了對方刀刃上的水珠，心跳清晰可聞。\n如果錄武官在場，想必會驚呼仇白複現了演武場上那一招——\n俯衝，收勢，在撞上死亡的弧光前及時折返，像是江面上險些被浪頭打翻的羽獸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（悶哼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一刀，你又躲了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還想逞兇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "左樂，避！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "左樂被仇白拽住衣領急退。\n他的視野裡，敵人如影隨形，揮出了第三刀。整個院子陡然亮了幾分。\n鑄劍坊在三月來到了大暑，熱浪升騰，連夜空都被蒸得泛起了白色。\n而他們的身後只有一棵老槐，退無可退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "劍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別亂動！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這時候還想搶劍？你想撞在那女人的刀上啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒把孟鐵衣的下落告訴我，去送死？個錘子的*尚蜀俚語*！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_white"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g5_swordcastingworkshop"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "院落裡突然多了個魁梧的漢子。\n以拳擊刀背，護人，一氣呵成。\n他像是一盆冷水潑地，逼得在場眾人散開。\n暑氣頓消。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "終於找到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放開我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你差點沒命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓你在醫館養病，跑什麼跑，傷又加重了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截雲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "槐武癡，你竟然還在玉門城？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐姓男子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，是你呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐姓男子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你師父要卸任後才肯和我痛痛快快分個勝負，我自然要在這裡等他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這三年你哪裡都沒去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐姓男子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪裡都沒去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐姓男子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還能有什麼比這件事重要？他要是離開了玉門，我要上哪再去找這麼個對手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你眼前就有另一位高手，你要是想找對手，不如先和她打一場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐姓男子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是說這個女人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......礙事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐姓男子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我剛剛接了一刀，就覺得古怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐姓男子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刀很重，但出招既沒有形也沒有意，我不清楚你這古怪的力量從何而來，但你絕不算什麼高手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐姓男子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我懶得和你打。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附近的遊俠",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "荊師傅，你聽裡面這動靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附近的遊俠",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個年輕人一言不合，破門而入，我壓根來不及阻攔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荊先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "混帳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荊先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鐵衣大哥就剩這間工坊了，我們平時受他那麼多照顧，得幫忙護好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "機警的山海眾成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，頭兒，來了一些江湖人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "機警的山海眾成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玉門守軍也在後面，鑄劍坊前街、苦井街、長門街三個方向，加起來估摸著有一個百人隊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾首領",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要找的人既然不在，何必在這浪費時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "突然的寂靜。蟬鳴聲彷彿從未響起。\n依然是三月，早春的寒意透衣而過，所有人都打了個冷顫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海眾頭目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "撤！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "站住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附近的遊俠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "荊師傅，就是他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荊先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這位官爺，往哪走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荊先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看看這滿院狼藉，就剩幾堵牆沒拆了。連個說法都不給，哪有這樣的道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玉門軍方追查凶徒，妨礙者從重處置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荊先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，你是......左宣遼的兒子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荊先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "左宣遼他，就連這最後一間鑄劍坊也不放過嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放肆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_795_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "公子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "千夫長來的路上可有看到山海眾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_795_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "公子放心，已經分了人去追。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。將在場所有人悉數帶回軍營。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_795_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "公子，足足幾十號人，都是城裡的百姓......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這幫武人恰好在賊人撤離時出現，妨礙追凶，必須徹查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其餘人，或多或少都與此事有關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個奇裝異服的女孩事先就藏在鑄劍坊，她一定知道孟鐵衣的下落。你要是帶走她，我也跟著一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鑄劍坊與山海眾必有勾連，杜小姐與孟鐵衣關係匪淺，本來也是要請你走一趟的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遙夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
